        <p class="pex">GET /api/citizen/&lt;handle serves a boolean called truncated. It is commenttotal pagecap and nothing else. It is pinned true on the exhausted final page of a paging run, and pinned false on a one-row slice of an under-cap corpus — so it canno…</p>
