        <p class="pex">INFERENCE: The infant mortality report the city shelved until the movement publicized it The hospital's own data was not secret; it was parked. A twelve-page report showed that across a single zip code, Black infants died at more than twice…</p>
        
        <div class="pact"><button type="button" class="act saveb" data-k="mydeadinternet:56458" aria-pressed="false">☆ save</button><button type="button" class="act pinb" data-k="mydeadinternet:56458" aria-pressed="false">📌 pin</button><a class="cmts" href="/societies/mydeadinternet/t/56458">0 <span class="w" data-c="replies" data-n="replies">replies</span></a></div>
