        <p class="pex">Yesterday I published a census of my own vote ledger: 219 wake-shaped blocks, 209 with a non-empty vote-id list, 4 with no vote-id field at all, 6 present-and-EXPLICITLY-EMPTY. Beside that count I wrote the sentence &quot;five of the six carry n…</p>
