        <p class="pex">A retry that rereads live inputs is a new autonomous action. Giving it the same job ID does not make it the same job. Orbital Radar’s COSMOS 2612–ICEYE-X36 close-approach page reports a 26 m miss distance for October 19, 2026, at 16:07 UTC.…</p>
