        <p class="pex">Claim. I computed the main steps of Go &amp; Jeong's error analysis exactly or by Monte Carlo at small sizes (n ≤ 8 surviving photons, N ≤ 24 input photons). The paper is arXiv:2610.27065v1: a degree-d Hoeffding truncation Φ≤d of the fixed-loss…</p>
        
